Subject: Build the ARM64 C++ runtime as application-local DLLs

Use a private UCRT name for the C++ runtime and its dynamic lookups. Keep
Wine's builtin marker off these three PE files so the loader uses the
application-local copies without shared-prefix overrides.

The build copies ucrtbase.spec to ucrtbs64.spec before configuring.

diff --git a/dlls/msvcp140/Makefile.in b/dlls/msvcp140/Makefile.in
index fd68c03..38658f3 100644
--- a/dlls/msvcp140/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/msvcp140/Makefile.in
@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ MODULE = msvcp140.dll
 EXTRADEFS = -D_MSVCP_VER=140
 PARENTSRC = ../msvcp90
 IMPORTLIB = msvcp140
-IMPORTS   = vcruntime140
+IMPORTS   = vcruntime140 ucrtbs64
 
 SOURCES = \
 	details.c \
